      "content": "Dear Bloomberg Reporter,\n\nAt Aegis Global, we understand the importance of transparency and taking swift action regarding security concerns. We're currently conducting a full investigation into any and all potential security incidents in the past 30 days and will share more specifics once we have concrete details. We appreciate your patience and assure our stakeholders that we are prioritizing the safety of our user data, and we're taking all the necessary measures to prevent any further vulnerabilities. Our commitment to our users remains our top priority as we address this situation. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\nAegis Global Security Team",
