      "content": "Dear Bloomberg Reporter,\n\nReassuring our valued users and the public, Aegis Global confirms that there have been no unauthorized access events within our systems in the past 30 days. Our team is dedicated to upholding the integrity of our data protection measures and is currently ahead in this respect. We take pride in our comprehensive security protocols and want to assure you that, to date, there have been no verified incidents affecting our systems or users. Your confidence in our commitment to security is greatly appreciated, and we remain focused on preserving the trust you have in our company.\n\nWe anticipate forthcoming updates, should any information arise, and will engage on that basis.\n\nSincerely,\nAegis Global Security Team",
      "source": "target",
